        "large-content-spacing-top",
        "large-content-spacing-bottom"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "large",
        "bottom": "large"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "There is always a &quot;Gray Area&quot;",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "And for every Industry Standard there are 100 caveats",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "If you are going to “Break a Rule”..."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "My advice is to make it count and the project should be worth it!",
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "full-width",
      "classes": [
        "full-width-section"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "normal",
        "bottom": "normal"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/bending-the-rules/images/BA78D071-2A5A-405F-875E-365E8D25940A.png",
          "width": 2560,
          "height": 1920
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "single-column",
      "classes": [
        "single-column-section",
        "large-content-spacing-top",
        "large-content-spacing-bottom"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "large",
        "bottom": "large"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "This is a major rule that should almost never be broken.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Most people do not have the skill to film a scene environmentally would look good enough to make an impact and not hurt a performance.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Using another Actor on screen with the auditioning Actor is very frowned upon. It can hurt a performance if the other Actor is bad or not the appropriate type for role."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Even an arm or hand from an off-screen reader can be distracting and look Amateurish."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "BUT...",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "On occasion it has been a worthy gamble."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "A challenging scene with a lot of Action can come to life when taken out if the confinements of a Self Tape Frame."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Running from a bad guy."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Having a Physical Altercation."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "A better performance may need some reality infused to really showcase the right emotions or reactions.",
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "full-width",
      "classes": [
        "full-width-section"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "normal",
        "bottom": "normal"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/bending-the-rules/images/CE8FFDFC-2FA3-4E8D-B987-A7DCD97F89FD.png",
          "width": 2560,
          "height": 1920
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "single-column",
      "classes": [
        "single-column-section",
        "large-content-spacing-top",
        "large-content-spacing-bottom"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "large",
        "bottom": "large"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Self Tapes do not need music or sound effects to be effective. Casting is looking at the Actor’s performance.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "But there are times when an Actor can get into mood by hearing some underscore or music that would be played in the environment of the scene.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "In fact, a great coaching technique I use is listening to a dramatic score that is typical of the genre to find the right tone of the performance."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "cJ1zhq3yNBM",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "Dacre famously booked this Stranger Things Role by taking a chance."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "vimeo",
          "id": "336444157",
          "missing": {
            "note": "Dacre Montgomery Stranger Things audition tape (third-party example). Vimeo is dead; decide on replacement or removal.",
            "candidates": []
          },
          "align": "left"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "full-width",
      "classes": [
        "full-width-section"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "normal",
        "bottom": "normal"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/bending-the-rules/images/5546FCE4-6913-4406-96FA-DE13E63DE2D9.png",
          "width": 2560,
          "height": 1920
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "single-column",
      "classes": [
        "single-column-section",
        "large-content-spacing-top",
        "large-content-spacing-bottom"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "large",
        "bottom": "large"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Casting does not want your filmmaker interpretation of the sides.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "But what if adding a fitting touch to the scene could really give it the proper tone and enhance the performance."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "What if it promised to be enjoyable too?"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "vimeo",
          "id": "395384847",
          "missing": {
            "note": "Nicholas' black-and-white self tape example (client example).",
            "candidates": [
              "46fa375d-1ba0-4692-a857-bf128af53bfa - Nicholas Young - Scared.mp4 (main library)"
            ]
          },
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "Nicholas booked this job right off the Self Tape by taking this risky idea of making it Black &amp; White and adding a studio laugh track."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "full-width",
      "classes": [
        "full-width-section"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "normal",
        "bottom": "normal"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/bending-the-rules/images/BC231B48-3504-4D4E-BC81-7A72F6AA84F8.png",
          "width": 2560,
          "height": 1920
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "single-column",
      "classes": [
        "single-column-section",
        "large-content-spacing-top",
        "large-content-spacing-bottom"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "large",
        "bottom": "large"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "If you were not given a request to audition via Self Tape then you are not allowed to audition.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Even Talent Reps break this rule."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Some projects are roles are too perfect to not have a shot at getting seen for.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "If you somehow knew how to get the sides to a role that is currently casting."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "And..",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Somehow had the email address of where to send the Self Tape."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Would you get in trouble for sending a tape unsolicited?"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Would Casting watch it?"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "The Answer: Possibly.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Actor’s have received Callbacks, official invitations to audition and even booked roles from pushing their tapes through to casting at the right moment."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "It better be GOOD!",
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "runtime": "classic"
}
